	<content contentuid="h9bb8be2dg7472g41c2g9bf9g9497590b39bf" version="1">星光狩猎</content>
	<content contentuid="hf14985fcg77adg4b1egadeag026100a9c563" version="1">你对&lt;b&gt;首领&lt;/b&gt;的攻击获得&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击掷骰&lt;/LSTag&gt;加值，并造成&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;额外伤害。与&lt;b&gt;首领&lt;/b&gt;的战斗开始时，你获得&lt;b&gt;[3]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="TemporaryHitPoints"&gt;临时生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h31fdd032gf23ag4722gae07g3fdb5be5acd8" version="1">使命感</content>
	<content contentuid="h408d9fd0g24d8g4de6gb8eagfc8edf5084c9" version="1">星光守护你，直到本次战斗结束。</content>
